// mu-rings — the face for mu-rings, a plugin the engine scans.
// Everything it IS comes from the ref below; what lives here is the ui.k7x beside this file.
extends("@engine/mu-rings")
// Played from notes, and an audio input too: what is wired into `in` excites the resonator beside
// its own exciters, and the lane's own audio does the same (engine/k7-runtime/docs/eurorack.md).
inputs([name("midi").type("midi"), name("in").type("audio").mandatory(false)])
